@OisinKyne None of those reasons for growth to stop apply to LSTs.

The choice not to issue a fixed amount of ETH was based on theory of discouragement attacks (https://t.co/ddwIwINp7n).

Final values were set here: https://t.co/f0DPmdXXBy but I agree there is a lack of written rationale.

@OisinKyne No, none of them apply to LSTs from the perspective of the principal.

"designed to deliberately price out decentralised setups" - obvious misrepresentation/bad faith so not worth responding to.

Ethereum's PoS was designed from the beginning to be used without delegation.
